btain the following curve:\n\n![](images/88/8897c9d1d91007a51d715d982e6b1137bdc5f83f6ef89802b4115522809d4db5.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186281384 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "18d0ae74-32e5-55b7-877c-4ab861664319" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b0/b0ea4cc71560a4cef1e55dff33726473b646fac2b825e0dff145380fc8f16e7e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278808} {:answer/id #uuid "38860aba-b4b7-5539-929e-ffd2b57b0212" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/1d/1d74a9400fa933f02f8a13536342c27fb6f39d04d55c5c6a25633265e3284f97.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279086} {:answer/id #uuid "a592aeca-df8f-52f7-9458-852ae2ec4427" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d4/d4843922097889cdaab70fef53186ebb1066a880226d45c1e088205a7b9d264a.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186280059} {:answer/id #uuid "da3434b4-a5fc-5c88-a5ee-dd98f785b778" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/ef/ef16043e1be5d4e99b6a61879feec1ca3addc2f654c73686343b2174821675fa.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186280517} {:answer/id #uuid "f0a3633b-68ea-5fbd-9947-f1987782c969" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/a4/a47ab05426c8551e22751c2e90d8e5ddf5750cfb5a531fe778d115bd0fb0de9e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186280692}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "38860aba-b4b7-5539-929e-ffd2b57b0212" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/1d/1d74a9400fa933f02f8a13536342c27fb6f39d04d55c5c6a25633265e3284f97.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279086} :answer-field/id #uuid "add89ef9-a8a3-5a48-b6fe-27d6972cf758" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186281130}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "76a9a95a-1f50-593a-bd3b-81528897e580" :question/math-academy-id "q-16198" :question/problem "Determine the graph of the following parametrically defined curve:\n\n$$\nx=7\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,\\,\\,\\,y=5\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ,\\,0\\le \\theta \\le 2\\pi \n$$" :question/worked-solution "We need to create a table of values and then sketch the curve. First, we work out the $x$-values using the formula $x=7\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta .$ This gives\n\n| **$\\theta $** | $0$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{6}$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ | $\\frac{2\\pi }{3}$ | $\\pi $ | $\\frac{4\\pi }{3}$ | $\\frac{5\\pi }{3}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $7$ | $\\frac{7\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ | $\\frac{7}{2}$ | $-\\frac{7}{2}$ | $-7$ | $-\\frac{7}{2}$ | $\\frac{7}{2}$ |\n| $y$ | $$ | $$ | $$ | $$ | $$ | $$ | $$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nNow, we work out the $y$ values using $y=5\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta .$ This gives\n\n| **$\\theta $** | $0$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{6}$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ | $\\frac{2\\pi }{3}$ | $\\pi $ | $\\frac{4\\pi }{3}$ | $\\frac{5\\pi }{3}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $7$ | $\\frac{7\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ | $\\frac{7}{2}$ | $-\\frac{7}{2}$ | $-7$ | $-\\frac{7}{2}$ | $\\frac{7}{2}$ |\n| $y$ | $0$ | $\\frac{5}{2}$ | $\\frac{5\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ | $\\frac{5\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ | $0$ | $-\\frac{5\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ | $-\\frac{5\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nPlotting these points, we obtain the following curve:\n\n![](images/de/debf9475589e7e242df986d1fffb8a97834d6ce550279fc82b0428001b661eaa.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186387437 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e3809196-0e72-568a-acb4-8f1806b011f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d1/d1cec5ea2da4a0b5f141bb24b4addc797defbc48e76cdfdbfab3a303e348b8cc.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387439} {:answer/id #uuid "d44a46da-960a-5000-b573-28968c62249a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/bc/bcb2b08bab14ce74347d37a0e896451750db0203ab830b835a83de6b7a81b61d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186387440} {:answer/id #uuid "a8c8555e-f76d-58d2-98de-66b72a2089cb" :answer/type {:db/ide